<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonikafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paulo Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu A Ɔtwerɛ Kɔmaa Tesalonikafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonikafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paulo Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu A</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔtwerɛ Kɔmaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonikafoɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkyea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Nwoma yi firi Paulo, Silas ne Timoteo nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TH 1:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Yɛde kɔma Tesalonika asafo a wɔyɛ Agya Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo nkurɔfoɔ no:<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛfiri Agya Onyankopɔn ne yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo nka mo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Aseda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Anuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ da biara yɛda Onyankopɔn ase ma mo. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ saa, ɛfiri sɛ, mo gyidie ne ɔdɔ a modɔ afoforɔ no mu den ara na ɛreyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Saa enti na yɛn ankasa yɛde mo hoahoa yɛn ho wɔ Onyankopɔn asafo ahodoɔ mu no. Yɛde ɔtaa ne amanehunu a mokɔ so gyina ano no hoahoa yɛn ho.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Yeinom nyinaa di adanseɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn bu atɛntenenee ɛno enti, wɔbɛkan mo afra wɔn a wɔbɛkɔ nʼAhennie a morehunu ho amane no mu. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Onyankopɔn bɛyɛ deɛ ɛtene. Wɔn a wɔbɛma mo ahunu amane no, ɔno nso bɛma wɔahunu amane, <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>na mo a mo ne yɛn rehunu amane no nso, wama moahome. Saa asɛm yi bɛsi wɔ ɛberɛ a Awurade Yesu nam ogyaframa mu firi ɔsoro reba a nʼabɔfoɔ atumfoɔ ka ne ho no, <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>abɛtwe wɔn a wɔnnim Onyankopɔn na wɔntie yɛn Awurade Yesu Asɛmpa no aso. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Wɔbɛkɔ daa ɔsɛeɛ mu na wɔayi wɔn afiri Awurade anim ne nʼanimuonyam mu <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>da a ɔbɛma nʼakyidifoɔ ne nʼasuafoɔ ahyɛ no animuonyam no. Mo nso, mobɛfra saa nkurɔfoɔ no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, moagye asɛm a yɛka kyerɛɛ mo no adi.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Yei enti na daa yɛbɔ mpaeɛ ma mo no. Yɛsrɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔmma mo ntumi ntena ase mma asetena a ɛno enti ɔfrɛɛ mo no. Ɔnnyina ne tumi so mma mo tumi, nyɛ mo apɛdeɛ ne biribiara a mo gyidie bɛka akyerɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no nyinaa. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Yɛbɔ mpaeɛ sɛdeɛ monam yɛn Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo adom so bɛhyɛ Awurade Yesu din animuonyam wɔ mo mu na mo nso, wɔahyɛ mo animuonyam wɔ ne mu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Nneɛma A Ɛdi Kristo Mmaeɛ Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Ɛfa yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo mmaeɛ a ɔrebɛba ne boa a wɔbɛboaboa yɛn ano akɔka ne ho no, mesrɛ mo, anuanom, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>mommma mo adwene mu nnyɛ mo nnaa sɛ ɛda a Awurade reba no aduru. Ebia, na obi rehyɛ saa nkɔm no anaa obi foforɔ nso gyina so reka asɛm. Anaasɛ nso wɔka sɛ yɛn nwoma a yɛtwerɛeɛ no bi mu na saa asɛm no wɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Mommma obiara nnaadaa mo saa ɛkwan yi so. Saa Ɛda no remma da gye sɛ atuateɛ a ɛtwa toɔ no aba ama wɔada ɔbɔnefoɔ no a ɔbɛkɔ daa ɔsɛeɛ mu no adi. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Biribiara a nnipa som na wɔbu no kronkron no, ɔbɛtia mu. Ɔbɛkorɔn ne ho wɔ ne nyinaa so na wakɔtena Onyankopɔn asɔredan mu na waka sɛ ɔno ne Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Monkae sɛ ɛberɛ a me ne mo wɔ hɔ no, na metaa ka yeinom nyinaa kyerɛ mo. <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Nanso, biribi na atwe no asɛn, na sɛ ɛberɛ no duru a, ɔbɛba. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Ɔbɔnefoɔ no di ne dwuma dada na deɛ ɛbɛba no remma da gye sɛ wɔayi deɛ ɔkura ne mu no afiri hɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Ɛno ansa na ɔbɔnefoɔ no bɛba, na Awurade Yesu nam nʼanom home so bɛtu no agu, na ɔde ne ba a ɔbɛba no mu animuonyam asɛe no. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Ɔbɔnefoɔ no nam ɔbonsam tumi so na ɛbɛba na wabɛyɛ anwanwadeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>na ɔnam bɔne so adaadaa wɔn a wɔbɛyera no. Wɔbɛyera, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔannye nokorɛ no anto mu, annɔ nokorɛ no amma wɔannya nkwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Yei enti, Onyankopɔn resoma nnaadaa tumi ma akɔhyɛ wɔn mu ama wɔagye nsɛm a ɛnyɛ nokorɛ adi. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Awieeɛ no ara ne sɛ, wɔn a wɔnnye nokorɛ no nni na wɔn ani gye bɔne ho no, wɔbɛbu wɔn atɛn.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Anuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ ɛberɛ biara yɛda Onyankopɔn ase ma mo a Awurade dɔ mo no. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnam Honhom no tumi so na Onyankopɔn yii mo sɛ nnipa a modi ɛkan a wɔbɛgye mo nkwa na wɔayɛ mo Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ kronkron wɔ mo gyidie a mowɔ wɔ nokorɛ mu no mu. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Onyankopɔn nam Asɛmpa no so frɛɛ mo sɛdeɛ mo ne Awurade Yesu Kristo bɛtena nʼanimuonyam no mu.<verse eid="2TH 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Enti, anuanom, monnyina pintinn na monka mo ho mmata nokorɛ a yɛkyerɛɛ mo wɔ asɛnka ne yɛn nwoma no mu no.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo no ankasa ne yɛn Agya Onyankopɔn a ɔdɔ yɛn na ɔnam nʼadom mu ahyɛ yɛn daa nkuran ne anidasoɔ pa no, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>nkyekyere mo werɛ, na ɔnhyɛ mo den asɛm ne adwuma pa nyinaa mu.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Mommɔ Mpaeɛ Mma Yɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Anuanom, asɛm a ɛtwa toɔ ne sɛ, mommɔ mpaeɛ mma yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Awurade asɛm bɛkɔ so atrɛ ntɛm sɛdeɛ ɛyɛɛ wɔ mo mu no. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Afei, mommɔ mpaeɛ mma yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Onyankopɔn bɛyi yɛn afiri abɔnefoɔ ne nsɛmmɔnedifoɔ nsam. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnyɛ nnipa nyinaa na wɔgye asɛm no di. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Nanso, Awurade yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ. Ɔbɛhyɛ mo den na wagye mo afiri ɔbɔnefoɔ no nsam. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Awurade ama yɛn mo mu anidasoɔ. Yɛwɔ anidasoɔ sɛ moreyɛ na mobɛkɔ so ayɛ biribiara a yɛbɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no. <verse eid="2TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Awurade nka mo ho na monnya ɔdɔ akoma sɛ Onyankopɔn ne abodwokyɛreɛ sɛ Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aniha Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Anuanom, yɛhyɛ mo wɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo din mu sɛ, montwe mo ho mfiri anuanom a wɔdi aniha na wɔnni mmara a yɛahyɛ ama wɔn no so no ho. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Mo ankasa monim pefee sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ deɛ yɛyɛeɛ no bi pɛpɛɛpɛ. Ɛberɛ a na yɛwɔ mo nkyɛn no, yɛanyɛ aniha. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Obi ammoa yɛn a yɛantua onii no ka. Yɛyɛɛ adwuma dendeenden. Awia ne anadwo nyinaa yɛyɛɛ adwuma sɛdeɛ yɛremfa sikasɛm biara nha mo adwene. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Yei nkyerɛ sɛ na yɛnni ho ɛkwan sɛ yɛbisa mo biribi de boa yɛn asetena. Yɛyɛɛ saa de yɛɛ nhwɛsoɔ maa mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Yɛwɔ mo nkyɛn no, yɛka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, “Obiara a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ adwuma no, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔma ɔdidi.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Yɛka saa asɛm yi, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛte sɛ mo mu bi yɛ anihafoɔ a wɔnyɛ hwee sɛ wɔnenam nkurɔfoɔ nnwuma ase. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Yɛde Awurade Yesu Kristo din hyɛ wɔn, bɔ wɔn kɔkɔ sɛ, wɔmmɔ bra pa na wɔnyɛ adwuma mfa mmɔ wɔn ho akɔnhoma. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Anuanom monnnyae papayɛ da.<verse eid="2TH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Obi wɔ hɔ a ɔrentie nwoma a matwerɛ abrɛ mo yi mu nsɛm. Sɛ mohunu obi saa a, monhwɛ no yie na montwe mo ho mfiri ne ho na nʼanim ngu ase. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Nanso, mommfa saa onipa no sɛ ɔyɛ ɔtamfoɔ na mmom, mommɔ no kɔkɔ sɛ mo nua.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Na ɔno asomdwoeɛ Awurade no ara mma mo asomdwoeɛ daa adeɛ nyinaa mu. Awurade ne mo nyinaa ntena.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Me ara me Paulo, me nsa ano atwerɛ a menam so rekyea mo ni. Saa ɛkwan yi ara so na mefa twerɛ nwoma.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo adom nka mo nyinaa.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
